  "docs_only": [
    { "url": "/docs/deposit/describe-records/", "what": "Field-by-field metadata docs (titles, creators, contributors, descriptions, funding, subjects, licenses, EDTF dates, resource types, publisher). The catalog has no per-field rows; suggest adding deposit.metadata.* rows, including 'Add authors from file', which the form has and the docs don't mention." },
